@Kyc.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295

### Register tenant + first admin (anonymous GraphQL)
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation($input: RegisterTenantRequestInput!) { registerTenant(input: $input) { tenantId tenantSlug adminUserId adminEmail } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "tenantName": "Acme Compliance",
      "tenantSlug": "acme",
      "adminEmail": "admin@acme.example",
      "adminPassword": "ChangeMe1"
    }
  }
}

### Login (anonymous GraphQL; returns short-lived JWT)
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation($input: LoginRequestInput!) { login(input: $input) { accessToken tokenType expiresInSeconds } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "tenantSlug": "acme",
      "email": "admin@acme.example",
      "password": "ChangeMe1"
    }
  }
}

### Authenticated GraphQL query (paste token from login)
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "query": "query { apiStatus }"
}

### Role gates (KYC-022 / KYC-031) — JWT `role` must match
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerAccessToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation { reviewerOnlyPing }"
}

### Customer creates draft case (KYC-031) — tenant/owner from JWT only
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation($input: CreateDraftCaseRequestInput!) { createDraftCase(input: $input) { id title status formData tenantId customerUserId createdAt } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "title": "Onboarding ACME",
      "formData": "{}"
    }
  }
}

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Ready (anonymous; 503 if Postgres is unreachable)
GET {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/ready

### Temporary REST register (same anonymous allow-list)
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/register-tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantName": "Acme Compliance",
  "tenantSlug": "acme-rest",
  "adminEmail": "admin@acme-rest.example",
  "adminPassword": "ChangeMe1"
}

### Temporary REST login
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantSlug": "acme-rest",
  "email": "admin@acme-rest.example",
  "password": "ChangeMe1"
}

